I’m ready to help you get started!  
First, let’s turn the ignition on:

```json
{
  "startEngine": {"ignitionMode": "START"}
}
```

Then, to keep everything secure while you’re on the road, I’ll engage the parking brake:

```json
{
  "activateParkingBrake": {"mode": "engage"}
}
```

Unfortunately, I don’t have a command to lock the doors directly. If you’d like, I can display the current status of the doors so you can verify they’re closed:

```json
{
  "displayCarStatus": {"option": "doors"}
}
```

Let me know if there’s anything else you’d like to set up before you hit the water!

